{% block subject %}We stopped reading your file because it expands unexpectedly{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The attachment expands to far more data than its size suggests. We stop
reading a file that behaves this way rather than put at risk the system that
handles everybody's complaints, so nothing inside it was opened.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please create the document again from the original: scan the pages at
{{ recommended_dpi }} DPI and save them as a fresh PDF, or attach each page
as a separate .jpg or .png picture. Files exported straight from a scanner
or a phone camera do not behave this way.{% endblock %}
